      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get what u mean about confirmation bias and stuff but it doesn't feel like that. it's too specific. like it's not just random words, it's things i've only thought about in my head. it feels more like my thoughts are actually triggering these things to happen. if i say something in my mind and then it shows up in the real world right away... doesn't that suggest there's some kind of connection between my focus and the way reality is moving? like i'm subconsciously directing the flow of stuff around me?",
